  "scope": "Fresh atomic-cycle necessary-condition screen using the previously frozen four-token/two-pool universe. Both v3-to-v4 and v4-to-v3 directions; exact integer output of first quoter becomes exact second input; same block per token/round and header recheck. Current registry status/address and chain/token/pool identity validation. No HL/perp leg, no exposure held to maturity, no constant multiplier assumption needed within same-token cycle. All 48 fixed route/size/round outcomes including errors retained. No route enlargement or retries after observing prices.",
  "limitations": "No complete router transaction execution, user transfer eligibility, gas or first-use approvals measured. All amounts in USDG. Positive gross surplus requires separately frozen execution/gas follow-up; negative gross already fails necessary condition. No wallet/signature/order or state-changing RPC.",
